# The aio mods are an overlay: the modconfig, the manifest, the texmap and the
# PDFT are ours and tracked; the bytes are Atari-Dude's All In One drop and are
# never committed here. tools/aio lays a copy of the drop out into these
# directories (files/, textures/, sequences/ under each mod_aio_*).
mod_aio_*/files/
mod_aio_*/textures/
mod_aio_*/sequences/
_to_delete/
